OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday remains rather cloudy with
OL,7,Fsome patchy rain. Thursday and Friday
OL,8,Fwill be largely dry and bright but
OL,9,Fchilly, cloudier with the odd shower
OL,10,Fpossible in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
